### Iniciar la verificación de identidad (HU1) -> 201
@baseUrl = http://localhost:4010
@token = test-token

POST {{baseUrl}}/identity-verifications
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: 1a2b3c4d-5e6f-4a7b-8c9d-0e1f2a3b4c5d
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "rut": "12345678-5",
  "document_image": "iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAEAAAABCAYAAAAfFcSJAAAADUlEQVR42mNk",
  "selfie_image": "iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAEAAAABCAYAAAAfFcSJAAAADUlEQVR42mP8"
}

### Token inválido -> 401 (HU5, caso de error)
POST {{baseUrl}}/identity-verifications
Idempotency-Key: 1a2b3c4d-5e6f-4a7b-8c9d-0e1f2a3b4c5d
Content-Type: application/json
Prefer: code=401

{
  "rut": "12345678-5",
  "document_image": "iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAEAAAABCAYAAAAfFcSJAAAADUlEQVR42mNk",
  "selfie_image": "iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAEAAAABCAYAAAAfFcSJAAAADUlEQVR42mP8"
}
